// Ops area: Panels: the icons the web's crundi-widgets.js draws inline (its
// IC set) that are not in ICON_PATHS (ui/icons.slint). Flat stroke icons in
// black, tinted where they are used, as the generated ones.

export global OpsPanelIcons {
    out property <image> up: @image-url("panels-icons/up.svg");
    out property <image> down: @image-url("panels-icons/down.svg");
    out property <image> shield: @image-url("panels-icons/shield.svg");
    out property <image> history: @image-url("panels-icons/history.svg");
    out property <image> expand: @image-url("panels-icons/expand.svg");
}
